# Never apply line-ending conversion or text diff/merge to binary formats —
# without this, Git's autocrlf can silently corrupt these files on checkout
# (e.g. rewriting embedded LF bytes inside a PDF to CRLF, breaking its
# internal byte-offset tables) on any machine/CI with core.autocrlf enabled.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
